# "Foretell [cost]": any time its owner has priority during their turn, they may pay {2} and
# exile this card from their hand face down, a special action [CR#702.143a,702.143b]; it becomes a
# foretold card [CR#702.143c]. The exile names the hand, so the ability functions only there
# [CR#113.6m]; the special action and the card's becoming foretold are separate events. Its owner
# may look at it as long as it remains in exile, and may cast it after the current turn has ended
# by paying its foretell cost, [cost], rather than its mana cost [CR#702.143a]: the rule rows
# `foretoldCardLook` and `foretoldCardCast` confer that look and that cast on every foretold card,
# this ability's [CR#702.143a] and an effect's [CR#702.143d].
ability foretell(cost: Cost) {
  lexical = {
    lemma = "foretell",
    parameters = [[Cost]],
    verbs = [{lemma = "foretell", past = "foretold", frames = [Monotransitive]}]},
  spelling = "foretell <cost>",
  body = [
    static(
      specialAction(
        duringPart(turn, you),
        mana([generic(2)]),
        sequentially([exileFaceDownFrom(thisCard, yourHand), gainDesignation(it, foretold)])))]
}
